{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":126,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":126,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/Student_Portrait_CH0109_Collection.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"天地","given_name":"尼娅","family_name_jp":"天地","given_name_jp":"ニヤ","family_name_kr":"아마치","given_name_kr":"니야","family_name_en":"Amachi","given_name_en":"Niya","family_name_zh_tw":"天地","given_name_zh_tw":"仁耶","family_name_cn":"天地","given_name_cn":"尼娅","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"业务相关请随时联络副部长~","main_relation":45,"relation":[72,48,46],"age":17,"grade":"三年生","height":166,"birthday":"01-01","hobby":"照顾后辈、阴谋","designer":"にぎりうさぎ","illustrator":"にぎりうさぎ","character_voice":"植田佳奈","character_voice_cn":"","release_date":"2025-05-21","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":"2025-10-21","school":9,"weapon_type":"HG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Large","special_appearance":true,"spine":[117,1000,996,990],"model":[202,245],"voice":[{"description":"ch0109_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"喵哈哈~今天也很开心~圣诞快乐~","text_original":"にゃは～今日は楽しい～メリークリスマス～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"和可爱的后辈一起买礼物回来吧~♪","text_original":"可愛い後輩にプレゼントを買って帰ろう～っと♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_xmas_3","category":"lobby","text":"……诶？给我的礼物吗？","text_original":"…え？私にプレゼントですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_xmas_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_xmas_4","category":"lobby","text":"……非，非常感谢。","text_original":"…あ、ありがとうございます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_xmas_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0109_Title","category":"lobby","text":"喵哈？碧蓝档案~","text_original":"にゃはっ？ブルーアーカイブ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/CH0109_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"喵~不想工作啊~","text_original":"にゃ～働きたくないですよぉ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"为什么一定要来夏莱工作啊~","text_original":"どうしてシャーレまできて仕事しないといけないんですかぁ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"明明在阴阳部都没干过工作......诶？还是做点事比较好？","text_original":"陰陽部でもしてないのに……え～？した方がいいですかぁ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_1_4","category":"lobby","text":"嘛，我想也是～","text_original":"まぁ、ですよねぇ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_1_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"喵哈，不愧是老师♪","text_original":"にゃはっ、さすが先生♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯哼，我就知道老师也是跟我一类的人哦？","text_original":"んふ、先生がこちら側の人間だって、知ってるんですよぉ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"又来了~，装傻也没用哦？来，一起悠闲摸鱼吧♪","text_original":"またまた〜、とぼけても無駄ですよぉ？ほら、一緒にゴロゴロしましょ♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"好好，我有在努力干活啦。","text_original":"はいはい、ちゃんと頑張ってますよっと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"是、是真的哦！","text_original":"ほ、ほんとですよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯~，真是散步的好天气呢。","text_original":"ん〜、いいお散歩日和ですねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"这么好的天不去外面快活快活吗~？","text_original":"こんな日はお外を楽しみませんか～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯呵呵……我想到一个好主意。","text_original":"んふふっ……良いアイデアが浮かびました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯嗯~？很在意吗？","text_original":"んん～？気になります？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_lobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"问了就没意思了哦？喵哈♪","text_original":"聞いちゃったらつまらないですよぉ？にゃはっ♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_lobby_5_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_login_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"哦呀哦呀，你还真是悠闲呢？能让我久等的人，也就只有老师了吧♪","text_original":"おやおや、随分とのんびり屋さんなんですねぇ？私を待たせる人なんて、先生くらいなものです♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_login_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_login_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯呵呵，感觉很新奇哦？喵哈！欢迎回来，开个玩笑♪","text_original":"んふふ、なんだか新鮮な気持ちですよぉ？にゃはっ！おかえりなさいませ、なんちゃって♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_login_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_login_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊啦，老师你来了呢。那就寒暄到这里吧……","text_original":"あら、いらっしゃったんですね先生。さてさて、挨拶はこの辺にして…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_login_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_login_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"一起来喝茶吧♪","text_original":"お茶にでもしましょうか♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_login_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_login_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"……不行吗？是稍～微有点太早了呢，喵哈哈！","text_original":"…ダメですかぁ？ちょ～っと、早かったかもですね、にゃははっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_login_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"喵、喵哈哈……喂~老师~？","text_original":"にゃ、にゃはは……もしも～し、先生～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊啦啊啦，可怕的表情……。不适合老师哦？","text_original":"あらあら、怖い顔……。先生には似合いませんよぉ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"难道……真的生气了？","text_original":"もしかして……本当に怒ってます？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"不是，总之……我知道的……喵哈……。","text_original":"いや、まぁ……分かっていますけど……にゃは……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"那个……是的……非常抱歉。","text_original":"ええと……はい……申し訳ありません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"不过你看，该怎么说呢~这里也有所谓的情况啊~？","text_original":"でもほら、なんといいますかぁ〜こちらにも事情というものがありましてねぇ～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"喵哈！？不对不对！","text_original":"にゃはっ！？いえいえ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"没这回事！我在反省！嗯！","text_original":"滅相もない！反省していますとも！ええ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"嗯……我真心反省了……请你原谅我吧？","text_original":"ええ……心から反省しておりますので……どうか、許してもらえませんか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_memoriallobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"真伤脑筋啊……我可是阴阳部的部长啊？不能偏袒一边……真是，非常困扰呢。","text_original":"困りましたねぇ……私、陰陽部の部長ですしぃ？肩入れしてはいけないのですけど……ほんと、困りますわぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"唔……这就是所谓的策略吧。哈！只、只是在自言自语哦？喵哈哈……。","text_original":"ふむ……これが駆け引きというやつなのですねぇ。はっ！た、ただの独り言ですよぉ？にゃはは……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"喵哈！？吓、吓我一跳。诶……只是有点被吓到哦？","text_original":"にゃはっ！？っ、少し、驚いてしまいました。ええ……驚いた、だけですよぉ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"老……老师……那个……什、什么都没有哦？喵哈哈~！","text_original":"せ……先生……その……な、なんでもないですよぉ？にゃははっ〜！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯哼哼♪","text_original":"んふふっ♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"那么，今天是什么日子呢~？","text_original":"さてさて、今日は何の日でしょう～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_birthday_3","category":"lobby","text":"……看来，不用多说了。","text_original":"……どうやら、言うまでもないようですねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_birthday_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_birthday_4","category":"lobby","text":"毕竟老师和我是什么的关系。再问下去就不识趣了。","text_original":"先生と私の仲ですから。これ以上の詮索は無粋というもの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_birthday_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_birthday_5","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，准备好了吗？生日礼物！","text_original":"んふふ、準備してますよね？誕生日プレゼント！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_birthday_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"唔姆。今天是老师出生的日子吧♪生日快乐。","text_original":"ふむ。今日は先生が生まれた日――ですよね♪お誕生日おめでとうございますぅ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"您说能像这样直接为您祝福……真是个好日子？修改为“您说能像这样直接为您祝福……真是个好日子？”","text_original":"こうして直接お祝いを伝えられるなんて……良い日ですねぇ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_birthday_player_3","category":"lobby","text":"嗯嗯~？不用这么戒备吧……只是纯粹的祝福而已……伤心了。呜呜呜。","text_original":"んん～？そんなに警戒しなくてもいいじゃないですかぁ……純粋にお祝いしてるだけなのに……悲しいなぁ。ぐすんぐすん。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_birthday_player_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"喵哈哈~百鬼夜行外面还有这么有趣的文化呢♪","text_original":"にゃはは～百鬼夜行の外にはこんな面白い文化があるんですねぇ♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯~？不给糖就捣蛋……？嗯嗯~？立场不是颠倒了吗~？","text_original":"ん～？お菓子がなければ悪戯する……？んん～？立場、逆になってません～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_halloween_3","category":"lobby","text":"话说回来，我又没带糖果……。","text_original":"というかお菓子なんて持っておりませんが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_halloween_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_halloween_4","category":"lobby","text":"你、你想做什么，老师！？","text_original":"な、何をする気ですか、先生！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_halloween_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"谨祝您新年快乐。今年也请多多关照……喵哈♪","text_original":"謹んで――新年のお祝いを申し上げます。本年もどうぞよろしくお願い致します……にゃはっ♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"就算是我也是清楚什么时间该做什么事情的哦？","text_original":"私だってこういう時ぐらいはちゃんと弁えてるんですよぉ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"全都，顺利顺畅大顺风♪真的好感动呢~","text_original":"万事、順調快調絶好調♪実に感動的ですねぇ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"唔姆……这种手法……又学到了呢♪","text_original":"ふむ……こんな手が……またひとつ賢くなりました♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"啊啦啊啦……老师也很坏呢？给我这么多没关系吗？","text_original":"あらあら……先生も悪ですねぇ？こんなに頂いちゃって、いいんですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"保持平衡是很难的。为了让天平保持水平，必须得不断移动才行。","text_original":"均衡を保つのも大変なんですよね。天秤を水平に保つためには、ずっと動き続ける必要があるんですから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"喵哈~……稍微休息下。嗯，我没在偷懒哦？","text_original":"にゃは～……ちょっと一息。んふ、サボってないですよぉ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"老师还有这种爱好吗……唔姆唔姆。","text_original":"先生にはこのような趣味が……ふむふむ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"令人着迷的光景呢♪喵哈哈！","text_original":"惚れ惚れする光景ですねぇ♪にゃははっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"果穗真是爱操心呢♪我可是有在好好工作呢……嘛，虽然是骗人的♪喵哈哈！","text_original":"カホは心配性だなぁ♪ちゃ～んと頑張って働いてるのに……。ま、嘘なんですが♪にゃははっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"这个很适合果穗……千世应该会很喜欢那个吧……。","text_original":"これはカホが……あっちはチセちゃんが喜びそうですねぇ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"玉——屋！喵哈！","text_original":"たーまやー！にゃはっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"稍微～为解您燃眉之急尽点犬喵之劳吧。","text_original":"ちょ～っと、猫の手、差し上げましょか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"嗯哼哼。我可什么都没做哦？","text_original":"んふふ。なぁんにも、してませんよぉ？私は。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"喵哈，让你们见笑了♪","text_original":"にゃはっ、お恥ずかしいところをお見せしました♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"绝景啊绝景啊~","text_original":"絶景かな絶景かな〜","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"好，整理一下吧♪","text_original":"さて、整えていきましょか♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"祭典才刚开始哦~？","text_original":"お祭りはこれからですよぉ～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"……您的心意我很感激。哎呀哎呀，你要我做什么呢？呵呵……但是，我也不能辜负老师的期待啊？真是伤脑筋啊♪","text_original":"……お気持ちはありがたいのですが。いやはや、私に何を求めていらっしゃるのやら。んふふ……ですが、先生のご期待を裏切るわけにもいきませんし？困ってしまいますねぇ……本当に♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"喵哈~非我不可吗……？","text_original":"にゃは～私じゃないとだめですか…？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"感谢我吧。我可是很少出动的呢~","text_original":"感謝してくださいね。私が動くことなんでそうそうないんですから～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"啊啦啊啦~","text_original":"あらあら～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"来~来~各位！睁大眼睛看好了♪百鬼夜行联合学院，阴阳部部长，天地尼娅在此！......开个玩笑。喵哈哈！","text_original":"さぁ～さぁ～皆の衆！刮目してご覧あれ♪百鬼夜行連合学院、陰陽部部長、天地ニヤのおなーりー！……なんてちゃって。にゃははっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/jp/ch0109_gachaget.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0109_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/kr/ch0109_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/kr/ch0109_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%20%E5%B0%BC%E5%A8%85/original/kr/ch0109_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0109_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"","text_o